      "text": "what is the hope of the hypocrite, Job 27:8. my flesh also shall rest in hope, Ps. 16:9 (Acts 2:26). mercy … according as we hope in thee, Ps. 33:22. in thee, O Lord, do I hope, Ps. 38:15. hope thou in God, Ps. 42:11 (43:5). hope of the righteous shall be gladness, Prov. 10:28. Hope deferred maketh the heart sick, Prov. 13:12. righteous hath hope in his death, Prov. 14:32. Chasten thy son while there is hope, Prov. 19:18. into the pit cannot hope for thy truth, Isa. 38:18. Blessed is the man … whose hope the Lord is, Jer. 17:7. Our bones are dried, and our hope is lost, Ezek. 37:11. Lord will be the hope of his people, Joel 3:16.",
